sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant Model as DeepSeek API
    participant Tool as Local Tool

    App->>Model: messages + tools + thinking enabled
    Model-->>App: assistant message (reasoning_content + tool_calls)
    App->>App: Append the complete assistant message
    App->>Tool: Execute each requested tool
    Tool-->>App: Tool result
    App->>App: Append role=tool, tool_call_id, content
    App->>Model: Updated messages + tools
    Model-->>App: Next thought, tool call, or final content
    loop Until tool_calls is empty
        App->>Tool: Execute requested tool
        Tool-->>App: Tool result
        App->>Model: Updated messages
    end
